    <h1>How to Sign Up and Start Your Free 14-Day Trial</h1>
    <p>Create your Bookwize account in under a minute — no credit card required.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-content">
    <p>Getting started with Bookwize is quick and completely free. Your 14-day trial gives you everything you need to see how online booking works for your business, with zero commitment and no payment information required.</p>

    <h2>What You Get with the Free Trial</h2>
    <p>Your trial account includes everything you need to test Bookwize with real clients:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>1 staff member</strong> — perfect for solo professionals or testing with one team member</li>
      <li><strong>3 services</strong> — add your most popular offerings to see how they look on your booking page</li>
      <li><strong>10 bookings per month</strong> — enough to experience the full booking flow with real appointments</li>
      <li><strong>Email notifications</strong> — confirmation emails, reminders, and follow-ups are all included</li>
    </ul>

    <blockquote>You do not need a credit card to start your trial. Just sign up and start accepting bookings right away.</blockquote>

    <h2>How to Create Your Account</h2>
    <p>The entire signup process takes less than 60 seconds. Here is exactly what to do:</p>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3>Step 1: Visit the Signup Page</h3>
      <p>Go to <a href="https://bookwizeapp.com">bookwizeapp.com</a> and click the <strong>Start Free Trial</strong> button in the top right corner. You can also go directly to the signup page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3>Step 2: Fill In Your Details</h3>
      <p>Enter your <strong>business name</strong> (this is what clients will see), your <strong>full name</strong>, <strong>email address</strong>, and choose a <strong>password</strong>. That is all — just four fields.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3>Step 3: Click Submit</h3>
      <p>Hit the signup button and your account is created instantly. You will be logged in automatically and taken straight to the onboarding wizard.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>What Happens After You Sign Up</h2>
    <p>As soon as you submit the signup form, three things happen:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your account is created</strong> — your business gets its own booking page and dashboard immediately</li>
      <li><strong>A welcome email is sent</strong> — check your inbox (and spam folder, just in case) for a welcome message with helpful links</li>
      <li><strong>You are logged in automatically</strong> — no need to go to a separate login page. You land directly on the onboarding wizard where you will set up your services, staff, and business hours</li>
    </ul>

    <p>The onboarding wizard walks you through every step of setting up your business. If you want a detailed walkthrough, read our guide on <a href="/blog/setting-up-your-business">setting up your business in under 5 minutes</a>.</p>

    <div class="tip">
      <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Use your real business name when signing up — it becomes part of your public booking page URL, and changing it later can affect any links you have already shared with clients.
    </div>

    <h2>No Strings Attached</h2>
    <p>Your free trial runs for 14 days with no credit card on file. When the trial ends, your account stays active — you just cannot accept new bookings beyond the trial limits. All your data, settings, and booking history are preserved. When you are ready to grow, you can <a href="/blog/upgrading-your-plan">upgrade your plan</a> at any time to unlock unlimited bookings, more staff, and more services.</p>

    <blockquote>It takes less than a minute to sign up, and you could be accepting your first booking within five minutes of creating your account.</blockquote>

    <div class="blog-cta">
      <h3>Ready to get started?</h3>
      <p>Create your free account and start accepting online bookings today.</p>
      <a href="/admin/signup">Start Your Free 14-Day Trial</a>
    </div>
